<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A constraint that operates primarily at the level of the signifier. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower and skos:related."@en .
